{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-inflatable-dinosaur-costume-sold-via-ebay-2606-0026","content_id":"c8421ab9-879e-446a-bab1-41b6a5dddaf7","description":"Product Safety Report for Inflatable Dinosaur Costume presenting a serious risk of burns and injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"ee797cf8-7501-4ff8-b278-0395cdc6fa9f","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-03T15:05:34+01:00","id":"ee797cf8-7501-4ff8-b278-0395cdc6fa9f","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:05:34+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a47c1ae1c8bd7ce25a5eb6c/2606-0026-product-safety-report-inflatable-dinosaur-costume.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Inflatable Dinosaur Costume sold via eBay</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of burns and injuries as the battery compartment is not secured with a screw and can readily be opened without tools.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Fancy Dress Accessories (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Inflatable, battery-operated dinosaur costume with USB cable.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_ee797cf8-7501-4ff8-b278-0395cdc6fa9f\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a47c1ae1c8bd7ce25a5eb6c/2606-0026-product-safety-report-inflatable-dinosaur-costume.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of burns and injuries as the battery compartment is not secured with a screw and can readily be opened without tools. These batteries may be placed in the mouth and swallowed, causing damage to the gastrointestinal tract. Improvements are also required to marking, labelling and documentation.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (AliExpress).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2606-0026</p>\n\n<p>Notifying Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:40:56Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-03","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-03T09:40:56+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-inflatable-dinosaur-costume-sold-via-ebay-2606-0026","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-inflatable-dinosaur-costume-sold-via-ebay-2606-0026","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-inflatable-